# Cloudflare Pages headers (ignored by GitHub Pages).
# COOP+COEP make the page cross-origin isolated -> SharedArrayBuffer ->
# multithreaded WASM: measured Whisper small at ~real time vs >20 min for a
# 15-minute clip single-threaded. `credentialless` (not require-corp) so the
# Tailwind CDN and Google-hosted assets keep loading; browsers that do not
# support it ignore it and simply stay single-threaded.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

# Immutable model/test fixtures can cache hard; app shell must revalidate.
/tests/fixtures/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
